  "chatbot": {
    "title": "AI HR Assistant",
    "aiMode": "Gemini AI + Rule-based",
    "ruleMode": "Rule-based FAQ",
    "topicsAvailable": "topics available",
    "placeholder": "Ask about HR policies, salary, leave, BPJS...",
    "welcome": "Hello! 👋 I'm your **HR Assistant** here to help you.\n\nI can answer questions regarding:\n- **Leave & permit** | **Salary & payroll** | **BPJS & insurance**\n- **Attendance** | **Overtime** | **Reimbursement** | and more\n\nPlease type your question below! 😊",
    "fallback": "❓ Sorry, I couldn't find an answer to this question in my policy database.\n\nPlease contact the HRD team directly:\n- 📧 hrd@perusahaan.com\n- ☎️ Ext. 1001-1003\n- 🕐 Monday-Friday, 08:00-17:00 WIB",
    "q1": "How to request leave?",
    "q2": "When is payday?",
    "q3": "What is my BPJS rate?",
    "q4": "How to claim reimbursement?",
    "q5": "Overtime policy?",
    "faqCuti": "**Leave Policy** 📅\n\n- Annual leave: **12 days per year** (accrued monthly)\n- Sick leave: Unlimited with medical certificate\n- Maternity leave: **90 days** (PP No. 78/2015)\n- Leave request must be submitted at least **3 working days** in advance\n- Emergency leave: Max 2 days, submitted via system\n\nTo apply for leave, use the **My Attendance → Leave Request** menu.",
    "faqGaji": "**Payroll Information** 💰\n\n- Salary is paid on the **25th** of every month\n- Payslips are available in the **Profile → Payslip** menu starting on the 24th\n- Components: Basic Salary + Allowances - Deductions (BPJS + PPh 21)\n- Salary revision is submitted through your direct supervisor to HRD\n\nFurther questions? Contact the payroll team at ext. **1001**.",
    "faqLembur": "**Overtime Policy** ⏱️\n\n- Overtime must be approved by your supervisor BEFORE being performed\n- Overtime rates refer to **Labor Law No. 13/2003**:\n  - First hour: 1.5× hourly wage\n  - Next hours: 2× hourly wage\n- Overtime on holidays: 2× (regular day) or 3× (public holiday)\n- Overtime claim must be submitted at latest **D+3**.",
    "faqBpjs": "**BPJS & Insurance** 🛡️\n\n**BPJS Employment:**\n- JHT: Employee 2% + Company 3.7%\n- JP: Employee 1% + Company 2%\n- JKK: Company 0.24% - 1.74%\n- JKM: Company 0.3%\n\n**BPJS Health:**\n- Employee: 1% of salary\n- Company: 4% of salary (max Rp 12 million)\n\nBPJS cards can be picked up at the HRD department.",
    "faqPph": "**PPh 21 Income Tax Information** 📋\n\n- PPh 21 is calculated from gross income minus PTKP and occupational allowance\n- PTKP 2024: TK/0 = Rp 54 million/year, K/0 = Rp 58.5 million/year\n- Progressive rate: 5% → 15% → 25% → 30% → 35%\n- Form 1721-A1 (Withholding Tax Slip) is available at the end of the year via HRD\n- Without NPWP rate is subject to +20% surcharge\n\nUse the **Form 1721-A1** menu to see your tax calculation.",
    "faqAbsen": "**Attendance Guide** 📍\n\n- Check-in time: According to shift set by supervisor\n- Method: QR Code / GPS Check-in / Face Verification\n- Lateness tolerance: 15 minutes (lateness will be calculated after that)\n- Clock-in outside area: Must use a valid GPS location\n- Forgot clock-in: Report to HRD on the same day via system\n\nTo clock in, access the **My Attendance** menu on the home page.",
    "faqReimburs": "**Reimbursement Policy** 📄\n\n- Submission must be made at latest **14 working days** after expense\n- Must attach proof (receipt/invoice/receipt)\n- Limit: According to category (Transportation, Meals, Accommodation, etc.)\n- Approval process: Max 5 working days\n- Payment: Together with the next month's salary\n\nSubmit in the **Reimbursements** menu on the application.",
    "faqPinjam": "**Employee Loan Policy** 💳\n\n- Eligible after working for at least **6 months**\n- Maximum loan: 2× monthly salary\n- Installments: Max 10 months, deducted directly from salary\n- Interest: **0%** (company internal facility)\n- One active loan per employee\n\nApply via **Loans** menu in the app or directly to HRD.",
    "faqTraining": "**Training & Development Program** 📚\n\n- Internal training: Schedule announced via Announcements\n- External training: Submitted via supervisor → HRD → Management\n- Training budget: Available for all employees (according to position)\n- e-Learning: Available on the company's internal platform\n\nSee the training schedule in the **Company Events** menu.",
    "faqKontak": "**HR Team Contacts** 📞\n\n- 📧 Email: hrd@perusahaan.com\n- ☎️ Ext: 1001 (Payroll), 1002 (Recruiting), 1003 (General)\n- 🕐 Service Hours: Monday-Friday 08:00-17:00 WIB\n- 📍 Location: 2nd Floor, Building A\n- 💬 Whatsapp HRD: See announcement board\n\nFor urgent needs, contact directly via phone."
  },
